==Battleground==
*4 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Haniwanwan]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[I.M. Phace]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Angelic Beast Rajakong]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Suidae Piggicus|Suidae Piggici]] spawn, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
**6 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**5 [[Haniwanwan]]s spawn, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**8 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**6 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[Loris|Lorises]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 73.33~76.67 seconds<sup>2,200f~2,300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Remember that you'll want to have a lineup that can deal with this stage as well as the [[Blue Crystal Desert|continuation stage]] that can follow. [[Ancient Egg: N106 (Rare Cat)|Mushroom]] is a good unit that can help kill the Rajakong, while [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen]] can help stall it. [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Naala]] should be brought, since she can help weaken the relic enemies here while helping a lot in the continuation, and her Behemoth Slayer can help with killing the Rajakong aswell.

